      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "60 feet. The Somnalu Oculus scrutinizes creatures around it, causing them to falter with nervousness and self-doubt. Upon entering the emanation, a creature must attempt a DC 34 Will save save. On a failed save, the creature is Stupefied 2 for 1 round. Regardless of the result of the saving throw, the creature is temporarily immune to scrutinizing presence for 1 minute.",
